    {
      "post_id": "524993009440403456",
      "text": "I woke up today believing Ottawa was a safe place for my family. I'll go to bed tonight thinking the same thing. Stay strong, stay calm.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:37:42 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525004839512981504",
      "text": "@Liams_Hockey @DownGoesBrown. I do. I work for DND and am in the downtown/market area. Still on lock down. And I agree with Sean.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:24:42 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250010619885691e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525009496448700418",
      "text": "@NYIFans4Garth @DownGoesBrown it's safer for the team and the fans if the game is cancelled. I don't think they caught the shooter yet?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:43:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.249939968760504e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525010715388952576",
      "text": "@Bluerocks67 @DownGoesBrown. I disagree with him. &amp; I know 100s of family of military that will be concerned about DND &amp; others.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:48:03 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250048395129815e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525001061988569088",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown. Would you feel that way if you had family that worked in the military, DND &amp; wore a uniform? A little trite brother.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:09:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499300944040346e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524993269235998720",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown Never let those who would attempt to sow terror, regardless their reasons win.  Good man!",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:38:43 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499300944040346e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524993944514351104",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown Best tweet I've read today. Thanks and best of luck to everyone in Ottawa.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:41:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499300944040346e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524994539556454401",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown Good on you. I'm glad you and yours are OK, and will continue to be.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:43:46 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499300944040346e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525016552593043456",
      "text": "@sophia_sweden @DownGoesBrown oh sorry I thought they got them.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 20:11:15 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250094964487004e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525011928276824064",
      "text": "@Liams_Hockey @DownGoesBrown. Wow. Never said that. But I do still feel safe and I am still on lock down surrounded by hundreds of likewise.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:52:52 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250110583991337e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524999055186079744",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown  Well put",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:01:43 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499300944040346e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524996338736717825",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown (not an anti-ottawa tweet, just a hapless idealist Leaf tweet)",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:50:55 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.249958955078369e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525012980501839872",
      "text": "@Liams_Hockey @DownGoesBrown. Tragic events happen. They do not define me or determine how I feel. I will walk out soon &amp; feel no less safe.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:57:03 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250113510734643e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525011058399133696",
      "text": "@Bluerocks67 @DownGoesBrown. You think this is all, oh well, nothing to see here move along?? Wow. Your prerogative. I disagree.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:49:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250048395129815e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524995895507836928",
      "text": "So ironic that a Leafs fan, sends out the most sensible, pragmatic tweet of the day @DownGoesBrown",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:49:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499300944040346e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
