    },
    {
      "post_id": "525018070407204864",
      "text": "@Bluerocks67 @DownGoesBrown. But for anybody to suggest families are not going to be concerned going forward to me, is idiotic.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 20:17:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250129805018399e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525011351073464320",
      "text": "@Bluerocks67 @DownGoesBrown. Monday is the 39th anniversary of the shooting at St Pius. I was there. We did not sleep peacefully &amp; soundly.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:50:34 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250048395129815e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524997328626003968",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown was in Fairmont for a conference this morning. Never any panic, measured, safe response to the situation from all.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:54:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499300944040346e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524993996876050433",
      "text": "@DownGoesBrown IMO they should've played tonight.  Together is better.",
